228
00:17:02,152 --> 00:17:07,435
Today you kept two remotes apart, and you
made a zombie branch on purpose, so you'll

229
00:17:07,475 --> 00:17:11,427
recognise one when it turns up.
Do Lab 7.5 while this is fresh.

230
00:17:11,467 --> 00:17:16,624
